<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Text To Word</title></head><body><h1>HalloweenVerse Design System</h1>
<h2>1. Brand Direction</h2>
<p>Create a cinematic, immersive, playful Halloween experience.</p>
<p>The website should feel like an interactive fantasy world rather than a generic business landing page.</p>
<h2>2. Colors</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Background: #090811</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Surface: #151322</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Primary Orange: #FF7518</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Secondary Purple: #9B5CFF</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Highlight Gold: #FFD166</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Main Text: #F8F5FF</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Muted Text: #B5AEC8</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Border: #302840</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Use color tokens consistently.</p>
<h2>3. Typography</h2>
<p>Headings: Space Grotesk.</p>
<p>Body: Inter.</p>
<p>Use fluid typography and maintain readable line lengths.</p>
<h2>4. Components</h2>
<p>Create reusable components for:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Navigation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Primary and secondary buttons.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Feature cards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Location cards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Modal dialogs.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Information panels.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Game cards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Costume cards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Event cards.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Form inputs.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Loading indicators.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Toast notifications.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Footer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2>5. Motion</h2>
<p>Use motion purposefully for:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Page transitions.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Button feedback.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Card interactions.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Scene entrances.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Environmental animations.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Respect reduced-motion settings.</p>
<p>Do not animate every element simultaneously.</p>
<h2>6. 3D Visual Direction</h2>
<p>Use stylized, cohesive assets with a consistent visual style.</p>
<p>Prioritize:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Recognizable silhouettes.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Atmospheric lighting.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Efficient geometry.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Controlled particle effects.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Subtle environmental movement.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Readable interactive objects.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Avoid excessive real-time lighting, heavy post-processing, and unnecessary high-polygon assets.</p>
<h2>7. Responsive Design</h2>
<p>Design mobile layouts deliberately rather than shrinking desktop layouts.</p>
<p>Use touch-friendly controls, simplified 3D interactions, and readable text.</p>
<h2>8. Accessibility</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Maintain readable contrast.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Provide keyboard navigation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Add visible focus indicators.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use semantic HTML.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Add accessible labels.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Avoid flashing effects.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Provide text alternatives to essential 3D information.</p>
</li>
</ul></body></html>